    "fall_side": "port",
    "range_label": "scrub MastDown 0->1 with mast damage; ramp Break 0->1 over the last ~third",
    "note": "Single driver from the mast HP zone: mastFrac = 1 - (masts_hp / masts_maxHp). scrub('MastDown', mastFrac) tops out leaning at 0.5 and fully collapsed at 1; setMorph('Sloop_Mast','Break', smoothstep(0.6,1.0,mastFrac)) adds the splintered snap near the end. The rig falls as one unit (yard/boom/gaff/flag/pennant bones parented under B_Mast); standing rigging + headsails (Sail_Jib, Sail_ForeStaysail) are skinned to B_Mast with a foot->hull gradient so they drag down but stay tied to the hull. +1 draw (Sloop_Mast, one Atlas_C primitive); no new materials. Ease the scrub over ~1.5-2.5s in code so it falls rather than snapping instantly."
  },
